<title>RUSSIA: WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - October 14.</title>
<headline>WEATHER - Conditions at CIS airports - October 14.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airports in the Northern Urals may be closed on October 15 and 16 due to strong winds, snow and low clouds, the Russian Weather Service said on Monday.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
